# Nostos — ignores
#
# Engine-specific sections are present for the three candidates so that
# whichever is chosen, the first commit after the decision does not accidentally
# add a Library/ or Intermediate/ directory. Delete the sections that do not
# apply once the engine is settled — an ignore file that covers engines the
# project does not use hides real files if one of those directory names is later
# reused for something else.

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# --- Claude Code -------------------------------------------------------------
# Local overrides and per-machine permission grants are not shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
# The working-copy lock lives inside .git and is already untracked.

# --- Build output ------------------------------------------------------------
build/
Build/
builds/
dist/
out/
bin/
obj/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp

# --- Profiling and capture artefacts ----------------------------------------
# Traces are evidence for a specific investigation, not repo history. Attach one
# to the task or the PR that needed it; committing them makes the repo grow
# without making any of them findable.
*.trace
*.nvvp
*.rdc
*.gputrace
captures/
profiling/

# --- Logs, crashes, local player data ---------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
crashes/
*.dmp
saves/
Saves/
local-config/

# --- Third-party art packs ---------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Oryx licences generally permit shipping the art
# inside a game and forbid redistributing it as art — and a public repo carrying
# the raw pack is plausibly redistribution. Read the licence actually purchased
# (tasks/known-gaps.md ART-1) before the first pack asset is committed. If it
# forbids it, uncomment the line below and fetch the pack at build time instead.
#
# assets/vendor/

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Never a signing key, a platform SDK credential, or a store token in the repo.
.env
.env.local
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
signing/

# --- Unity -------------------------------------------------------------------
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.booproj
sysinfo.txt
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage

# --- Unreal ------------------------------------------------------------------
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/

# --- Godot -------------------------------------------------------------------
.godot/
.import/
export.cfg
export_presets.cfg
*.translation

# --- Node (tooling, asset pipeline, web build) -------------------------------
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.next/
coverage/

# --- Rust / C++ tooling ------------------------------------------------------
target/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
compile_commands.json
